            <div xml:id="d302">

                <pb facs="0346" n="270" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg270"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 351.117/68</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Sharp to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1853</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 11, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to enclose herewith in
                    translation a note received from the Foreign Office with reference to the case
                    of Mr. Adrien J. Kirghis. From this note it appears that the acquisition of a
                    foreign nationality by Mr. Kirghis had never been noted on the French military
                    rolls and that, having been born in France of parents also born in France, he
                    was considered a Frenchman and is about to be called to the colors. Furthermore
                    I was informed by Mr. Kirghis that before sailing from New York for Bordeaux he
                    was advised by the authorities that on landing in France he was liable to be
                    drafted into the French army. In spite of this warning he however persisted in
                    his original intention.</p>
                <p>I have [etc]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. G. Sharp</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d302-a1.xml" xpointer="d302-a1"/>
            </div>
